  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\"><figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-left show-info-icon\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/d/d9/Piggybank_icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20200106072002\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Piggybank icon\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/d/d9/Piggybank_icon.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20200106072002\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"176\" class=\"thumbimage\" loading=\"lazy\"></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3APiggybank_icon.png\" class=\"info-icon\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p>The&#160;<b>Piggy Bank&#160;</b>is a feature within the&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/valley-31465\" title=\"Valley\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Valley</a>&#160;that allows players to accumulate <a href=\"/wiki/token-31466\" title=\"Token\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">tokens</a>&#160;that can be stored for use at the end of that current valley season or to use in future seasons. If the player did not use all of their <a href=\"/wiki/token-31466\" title=\"Token\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">tokens</a> during a season, those can be transferred to the <b>Piggy Bank</b> for use during the next valley season.&#160;\n</p><p>The maximum amount of tokens is 1,200.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Opening the Piggy Bank</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-left show-info-icon\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/1/1d/Icon_piggybank_big_open.png/revision/latest?cb=20200106073804\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Icon piggybank big open\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/1/1d/Icon_piggybank_big_open.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20200106073804\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"143\" class=\"thumbimage\" loading=\"lazy\"></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3AIcon_piggybank_big_open.png\" class=\"info-icon\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p>The&#160;<b>Piggy Bank</b>&#160;can be opened by spending 25&#160;<span>dia</span><span title=\"Diamond(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"dia\"><img alt=\"dia\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/e/ea/Diamond.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160312154318\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Strategy tips</b></span></h3>\n<ul><li>You need to calculate each number of tokens before opening it. You should ensure yourself that amount of tokens are efficient for 2 seasonal rewards.</li>\n<li>If you don't have tokens enough for purchasing 2 seasonal rewards, don't recommend opening piggy bank. However, if you still would like to open, you need to calculate prize of <a href=\"/wiki/supplies-23344\" title=\"Supplies\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">supplies</a> which you want and compare with the opening cost before decision.</li></ul>\n<table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260901030435\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.022 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.032 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 65/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 517/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 18/2097152 bytes\nHighest exp