  "wikitext": "[[File:Piggybank_icon.png|thumb|left]]\nThe '''Piggy Bank '''is a feature within the [[Valley]] that allows players to accumulate [[Token|tokens]] that can be stored for use at the end of that current valley season or to use in future seasons. If the player did not use all of their [[Token|tokens]] during a season, those can be transferred to the '''Piggy Bank''' for use during the next valley season. \n\nThe maximum amount of tokens is 1,200.\n{{Clr}}\n----\n==='''Opening the Piggy Bank'''===\n[[File:Icon_piggybank_big_open.png|thumb|left]]\nThe '''Piggy Bank''' can be opened by spending 25 {{Infoicon|dia}}\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Strategy tips'''===\n* You need to calculate each number of tokens before opening it. You should ensure yourself that amount of tokens are efficient for 2 seasonal rewards.\n* If you don't have tokens enough for purchasing 2 seasonal rewards, don't recommend opening piggy bank. However, if you still would like to open, you need to calculate prize of [[supplies]] which you want and compare with the opening cost before decision.   \n\n{{Languages\n|es = Alcancía\n}}\n[[Category:Valley]]",
